in the Atlantic Ocean.

00:06:21.234 --> 00:06:23.601
This has been
"Dance Your Hat and Gloves Off."

00:06:23.601 --> 00:06:25.100
Thank you for playing,
and thanks to you,

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.834
all you boys and girls and
friends and fans in TV land.

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:30.067
From the jocks and rockers
to the bobbysoxers

00:06:30.067 --> 00:06:32.133
to the TikTok kids
with all the rizz,

00:06:32.133 --> 00:06:33.767
just dig that scene,
if you know what I mean,

00:06:33.767 --> 00:06:35.934
and you just might be
on the dancing queen.

00:06:35.934 --> 00:06:38.133
So tell your friends
to catch all the action.

00:06:38.133 --> 00:06:40.501
I'm on the next season
of "Naked Attraction."

00:06:40.501 --> 00:06:42.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.667 --> 00:06:47.267
I got a real small part,
if you catch my drift.

00:06:47.267 --> 00:06:48.934
It's...

00:06:48.934 --> 00:06:50.701
[ Cymbal crash ]

00:06:50.701 --> 00:06:52.934
So, so many. It's like an innie.

00:06:52.934 --> 00:06:54.767
I guess you could say
I'm a bit of a hunk,

00:06:54.767 --> 00:06:57.334
